```

This assert statement checks that the amount to be transferred ('amnt') is less than or equal to 100 and greater than 0. If these conditions are not met, it produces an AssertionError with the error message 'Transfer amount is not greater than 100 and is positive'.--------------------```py
assert transfer(Person('Anna'), Person('Bob'), 50) == True, "Fewer than 100"
assert transfer(Person('Anna'), Person('Bob'), 200) == False, "More than 100"
assert transfer(Person('Anna'), Person('Bob'), -50) == False, "Negative amount"
assert transfer(Person('Anna'), Person('Bob'), 0) == True, "Zero amount"
